<title>USA: Fla. 465 MW Stanton coal-fired plant up - sources.</title>
<headline>Fla. 465 MW Stanton coal-fired plant up - sources.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 465 megawatt (MW) coal-fired Stanton generating station resumed operation after being shut in October for seasonal maintenance, sources familiar with the operation of the plant said.</p>
<p>&quot;It came back up Sunday,&quot; a source said.</p>
<p>Orlando Utilities Commission is the operator and part-owner of the Stanton plant, located in Orlando, Florida. The other owners are Florida Municipal Power Agency and Kissimmee Utility Authority.</p>
<p>--New York Power Desk +1 212 859 1622</p>
